<title>UK: UK Jan oil output down 60 kbpd to 2.67 mln-WoodMac.</title>
<headline>UK Jan oil output down 60 kbpd to 2.67 mln-WoodMac.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. oil production fell to 2.67 million barrels per day (bpd) in January, consultants Wood Mackenzie said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>This corresponds to a decrease of 62,000 bpd on the previous month's figure but an increase of 70,000 bpd on the total for January 1996.</p>
